                    'The Enlightenment (17th and 18th centuries) further turned this sensibility inward, philosophically and psychologically advancing the secularization of humankind. During the Industrial Revolution (18th and 19th centuries), we see the physical manifestation of our mechanistic reductionism and progressive optimization. Now, in our current Information Age, it looks like our final descent into nihilistic materialism is imminent. Disillusioned as we are, the project becomes finding a way back to the Garden.',
