        imageAlt: 'The parable of the one-eyed king \u2014 perception, awakening, and the contemplative art of learning to truly see',
        heroImage: 'https://horizons-cdn.hostinger.com/1f3d6402-32eb-49eb-a99b-46cfb57570e7/6e185c5e78b2c18bfaf1e1dd9f2b016d.png',
        dek: 'On the parable of the one-eyed king, the nature of perception, and the work of becoming fully awake.',
        traditions: ['western-esoteric'],
