                    'This piece was put together for a show for Mario from Symbolic Studies Podcast, and it opens up a subject I\u2019m going to be returning to in a much bigger way in the future: sigils, talismans, symbols, and the actual mechanics behind how they affect the practitioner.',
                    'Because a lot of people talk about magical symbols as if they are only aimed outward. A sigil is made to attract something. A talisman is made to protect something. A seal is made to bind, command, open, close, banish, or influence something in the world. And that traditional language matters. I\u2019m not here to throw it away.',
