                    'A planetary seal may resemble a hidden order through geometry. It may point toward a planet, spirit, angel, intelligence, or force through tradition. It may also work because the practitioner has been trained to recognize that mark as meaningful. The symbol is not just seen. It is interpreted. It is entered. The practitioner does not merely look at the sign. The practitioner enters a relationship with it.',
